WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:06,060
Shen Zhenzhu

2
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:17,180
Shen Zhenzhu blames me for getting to this point.

3
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,660
I will never let her succeed

4
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:59,640
Only there

5
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:14,560
Shen Zhenzhu

6
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:16,320
You really thought you left me here

7
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,440
you can replace me

8
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:18,600
three days later

9
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:20,240
It’s my wedding with Han Mo

10
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:21,800
Cooperation between Shen and Han

11
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:23,640
It will also be officially finalized at the wedding

12
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,600
I don't show up

13
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:25,840
The wedding can't happen

14
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,760
The Shen family will never give up.

15
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,440
I must go back alive

16
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:30,960
I personally ruined your Merlot
